   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Beginning in the second quarter of 2024, MPC weighted the blended crack spread 42 percent Gulf Coast, 40 percent Mid-Continent and 18 percent West Coast, based on its refining capacity by region in each period (MPC FY2025 Form 10-K, Item 7). The weights for 2026 are in the Q2 2026 Form 10-Q (MPC-S03; mpc-performance-measures-evidence.md, row 10)."
   }
  ],
